  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed rear and side roof extension would result in an incongruous, unsympathetic and over dominant form of development which would be highly visible within the streetscene and from neighbouring properties and rear gardens.  Furthermore, the proposal would not be subservient to the main building and due to the overall form would be out of keeping with the prevailing pattern of development in the street and local area.  As such, the proposal is contrary to policy 28 of the Sutton Local Plan 2018 and the Supplementary Planning Documents 4: The Design of Residential Extensions and 14 'Creating Locally Distinctive Places'.\r"
  ],
